---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Elysium UI">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-40 pb-24">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-[700]">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[0.85rem] text-muted">Draft — pending legal review. Last updated July 2026.</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/90">
      <p>We keep this simple, because we collect almost nothing.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-[650]">This website</h2>
      <p>
        elysiumui.com sets no cookies and runs no trackers. We use Cloudflare Web
        Analytics, a cookie-less, privacy-first analytics service that records
        aggregate page-view counts only — no personal profiles, no cross-site
        tracking.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-[650]">Downloads &amp; purchases</h2>
      <p>
        Framework installs come from PyPI, which has its own privacy policy.
        Designer trials, purchases, and license activation are processed by
        PyLocket; the information you provide at checkout (name, email, payment)
        is handled by PyLocket and its payment provider under their policies. We
        receive your license/contact details solely to provide support and
        updates.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-[650]">Email</h2>
      <p>
        If you email support@elysiumui.com we keep the correspondence to help
        you; we don't add you to marketing lists.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-[650]">Contact</h2>
      <p><a class="text-iris hover:underline" href="mailto:support@elysiumui.com">support@elysiumui.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
